  "lineage": "South African deep-house-and-jazz hybrid genre emerging in mid-2010s in Johannesburg and Pretoria. Characterized by extremely-deep \"log drum\" synthesizer-bass, jazz-piano keyboard work, slow-to-mid tempo (108-115 BPM), and extended drawn-out arrangement structures. Kabza De Small (\"King of Amapiano\"), DJ Maphorisa, and Vigro Deep constitute the canonical producer-roster; the genre spread internationally through 2020-onward through TikTok-Pretoria-dance-circulation and is now the dominant African-dance-music form continent-wide.",
